# What `vercel deploy` uploads for the clinician portal: the portal, the shared packages it imports (engine, shared,
# reports) and the workspace files pnpm needs. Other workspace projects keep only their package.json (the lockfile
# check needs them); their code, native iOS/Android folders, docs and data stay home.
